# Versioned first release: independent web Demo and selected design documentation.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/web/
!/docs/

# Keep local historical documents/experiments out; admit the curated documentation below.
/docs/**
!/docs/**/
!/docs/DECISIONS_AND_OPEN_QUESTIONS.md
!/docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ROADMAP.md
!/docs/README.md
!/docs/TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md
!/docs/architecture/AGENT_EVENT_CONTRACT.md
