!/docs/production/B20_S1_SPATIAL_BLUEPRINT.md
!/docs/production/CURRENT_PROJECT_STATE.md
!/docs/production/QUALITY_GATES.md

# Reproducible outputs and local tooling state are never source.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/coverage/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# 3D source/export assets stay in the local archive for the future 3D track.
*.blend
*.blend[0-9]*
*.glb
*.gltf
*.fbx
*.obj
*.stl
*.usd
*.usdz
*.zip
